\subsubsection{MSCA-KV}


The proposed MSCA computes the attention across frames,
that is,
patches in $t$-th frame are also attended
from patches in frames at time $t+1$ and $t-1$. 
This can be done with shift operations;
after generating $Q, K, V$ at each frame,
these are exchanged with the neighbor frames.

First, $K$ and $V$ are expressed as stacks of keys and values of patches at different frames as follows;
