    K^{(t)} &= [K^{(t)}_0, K^{(t)}_1, \ldots, K^{(t)}_N] \\
    V^{(t)} &= [V^{(t)}_0, V^{(t)}_1, \ldots, V^{(t)}_N],
\end{align}
where $K^{(t)}_n, V^{(t)}_n \in \R^D$ are the key and value of patch $n$ at time $t$.
